## . [flutter] Mobile tools=flutter
run                      Development    inferred high   safe        .          flutter run :: Run the Flutter app
test                     Testing        inferred high   safe        .          flutter test :: Run Flutter tests
analyze                  Quality        inferred high   safe        .          flutter analyze :: Analyze Dart source
format                   Quality        inferred medium safe        .          dart format . :: Run dart format
build:apk                Build          inferred medium safe        .          flutter build apk :: Build the Android APK
build:appbundle          Build          inferred low    safe        .          flutter build appbundle :: Build the Android App Bundle
build:ios                Build          inferred low    safe        .          flutter build ios :: Build the iOS app
build:web                Build          inferred medium safe        .          flutter build web :: Build the web app
generate                 Build          inferred high   safe        .          dart run build_runner build --delete-conflicting-outputs :: Generate code with build_runner
test:integration         Testing        inferred high   safe        .          flutter test integration_test :: Run Flutter integration tests on a device
pub:get                  Other          inferred low    safe        .          flutter pub get :: Install Dart dependencies
